{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act17side_level_act17side_st05",
  "groupId": "act17side",
  "stageId": "act17side_04",
  "title": "登陸點",
  "storyCode": "SN-ST-5",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act17side/level_act17side_st05.txt",
  "sourceHash": "62971c24d049b69ee1a85abfb5645f2b524080f29056dc7cdd8d4896708e6141",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂亞戈",
      "text": "哈......這些，噁心的地面，是怎麼回事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂亞戈",
      "text": "是這些恐魚嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿瑪雅",
      "text": "蒂亞戈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂亞戈",
      "text": "......阿瑪雅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂亞戈",
      "text": "怎麼回事？這些深海教徒，你不是說他們不會出現嗎？他們把這裡弄得一團糟......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿瑪雅",
      "text": "蒂亞戈，我是來道別的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂亞戈",
      "text": "什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿瑪雅",
      "text": "時候差不多了，而現在機會難得，我只是這麼覺得。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂亞戈",
      "text": "我不明白......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿瑪雅",
      "text": "蒂亞戈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿瑪雅",
      "text": "審判官已經到了。足足三位。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂亞戈",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿瑪雅",
      "text": "喬迪在他們手上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂亞戈",
      "text": "唔——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿瑪雅",
      "text": "別急，蒂亞戈。喬迪是以自己的意志回到的這裡。三名審判官，你能做些什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂亞戈",
      "text": "他知不知道被審判庭發現意味著什麼？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿瑪雅",
      "text": "你說過很多次，我想他應該知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿瑪雅",
      "text": "但人就是這樣。趨利避害只是邏輯推論得出的結果，人複雜得多，而這種複雜不能被輕易評判......我不會說喬迪愚蠢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂亞戈",
      "text": "現在可不是當道德家的時候——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿瑪雅",
      "text": "我們談論的是性質，而非道德，蒂亞戈鎮長。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿瑪雅",
      "text": "人之性具有美感。連時間都否定不了這一點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂亞戈",
      "text": "......你到底要說什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿瑪雅",
      "text": "你憎恨審判庭嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂亞戈",
      "text": "......我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿瑪雅",
      "text": "恐魚確實遍佈小鎮，但是，蒂亞戈，回憶一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿瑪雅",
      "text": "那個雨夜，那些懲戒軍，他們闖入鎮上，撕碎房門。慘叫不絕於耳，蓋過淅瀝瀝的雨點......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂亞戈",
      "text": "不，別說了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿瑪雅",
      "text": "——現在呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿瑪雅",
      "text": "海的痕跡蔓延在這座小鎮上——你聽見慘叫了嗎？你看到無理由的殺戮或狩獵了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿瑪雅",
      "text": "沒有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂亞戈",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿瑪雅",
      "text": "現在的格蘭法洛——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿瑪雅",
      "text": "——徒留靜謐而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬迪",
      "text": "海洋原來，這麼廣闊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "海風吹過。\n喬迪不可置信地看著眼前的一切。他本以為海平線就是天空的終點。\n直到親眼確認這無限延伸的浪潮時——喬迪——這個阿戈爾人突然產生了一個疑惑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬迪",
      "text": "為什麼人類從來沒有過探索它的欲望呢......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "text": "......除非星星是有規律的地圖，或者雙月能變成信號塔，否則我們怎麼才能在這一片汪洋上確認方位？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬迪",
      "text": "呃，星星是沒有規律的嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "text": "去問專業的天文學家好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬迪",
      "text": "那如果......阿戈爾真的在海面以下，那阿戈爾究竟有多大......比伊比利亞還要大嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "text": "那邊有幾個真正的阿戈爾人，你要不要去問問看？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬迪",
      "text": "她們好像都有心事的樣子，一臉嚴肅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "鯊魚，你在聽什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "text": "......風。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "text": "海風中夾雜著親緣的饋贈，讓我......很安心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "越接近海洋，她越是這樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "在鹽風城的時候她明明......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你知道原因嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "我的猜測只會干擾你的判斷，我們的眼前是戰鬥。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "僥倖上岸之後，你有試過回到海洋嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "當然，然後失敗了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "它們無窮無盡，包圍著我，我只是遊出去沒多遠就失去了力氣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "我試了很多很多次......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "但是你還活著。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "我們都清楚我們自己身上發生的變化，斯卡蒂。你也是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "鯊魚雖然遭受了一些傷害，但她是我的獵人，她才不會那麼脆弱。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "她與我們是一樣的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "text": "“幽靈鯊”，曾是深海教會的受害者。源石，這種東西不存在於海洋，對她產生了各種影響。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "text": "為何要帶著這樣的不確定因素？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "我們回家，與你無關。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "text": "家？但是阿戈爾的情況不會比伊比利亞好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "提起你的燈，審判官。先準備迎接敵人吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "text": "唔，它們來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "text": "最後一個問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "text": "深海獵人真只有三人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "如果還有別人，我早該找到他們才是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "......為什麼這麼問？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "突然出現的恐魚",
      "text": "（詭異的窸窣聲）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "航向準確嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "text": "無誤。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "......靠近伊比利亞之眼後，恐魚展現出了更明確的敵意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "那裡興許已是它們的巢穴，在船上纏鬥實在浪費時間。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "斯卡蒂，鯊魚，你們保護這艘船，也順便看著點那些原始的信號導航設備。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "我去海裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "我和你一起。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "你在海裡更強，但它們也是。而且我們不能在海裡流血，那太危險。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬迪",
      "text": "怎、怎麼了？！又有怪物襲擊了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "text": "不，看不見！我們不知道水下發生了什麼，但是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "text": "沉悶的轟鳴......！下面發生了什麼？她在下面戰鬥？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "不。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "她只是在......移動。畢竟在水裡，她更快。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "text": "......在水裡怎麼可能比在空氣中速度還快......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "習慣吧，或者是技巧一類的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "text": "恐魚隨她去了。她開闢了一條道路。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "text": "艾麗妮，你帶著布雷奧甘的後裔繼續掌舵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "text": "速度快，在敵人包圍我們之前。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "text": "他們已經出發了，海上不會平靜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "text": "如果擔心他們，我們就趕緊完成我們的事情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "text": "格蘭法洛本就是收復燈塔的前哨，我們要做的只是重拾這一點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "text": "伊比利亞竟然已經能夠利用阿戈爾的技術抵禦溟痕的入侵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "text": "它們進化的速度快過任何一位科學家的大腦，要贏，就要不擇手段。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "text": "哪怕動用了一支軍隊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "text": "......這是座不起眼的小鎮。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "text": "也許有更多的戰略重地等著審判庭一一收復。更好的作戰地點，更宏偉的高牆與碉堡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "text": "但，有時候，從手邊事做起，也不是什麼壞事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "text": "有多少伊比利亞人願意與浪潮廝殺至死，我們就有多少人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "text": "現在，開始掃除吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐魚",
      "text": "（持續的窸窣聲）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "text": "喂......我們還沒到嗎？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬迪",
      "text": "按、按照海圖，我們至少已經能看見它了才對啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "text": "長官！再深入下去，恐怕......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "text": "不。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "text": "抬頭看吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "text": "什麼？明明黑漆漆一片，我什麼都......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬迪",
      "text": "不......那不是......那不是天空，那是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "那裡已是它們的巢穴。離海岸很近，難怪那些恐魚數量如此之多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "砍完就可以了吧。像以前那樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "......對，像以前那樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "鯊魚？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "text": "那就是......他們的眼睛？為什麼我能感覺到如此熟悉？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "它蒙於污穢許久，早已睜不開眼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "text": "我來開路。喬迪，你跟我們走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬迪",
      "text": "啊。好、好......希望我能幫上忙......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "text": "不，是你必須要做到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "text": "否則，我們會轉變戰略，優先確保審判庭的技術人員能安全抵達這裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "text": "在這場戰役中，我們無暇顧及一個自說自話的阿戈爾人的死活。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬迪",
      "text": "是！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "你似乎很著急。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "text": "阿戈爾人。你不明白重新抵達這座島嶼的意義。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "意義？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "text": "......從懲戒軍發現燈塔殘存的訊號至今，我們十七次試圖登陸這裡，其中有八次成功踩上這片礁石。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "text": "數百名戰士，三位審判官，沒有人活著回去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "text": "難道阿戈爾的優越道德，教你們放棄對英雄的尊重與緬懷？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "text": "長官和我......伊比利亞人會為那些葬身大海的亡魂祭奠。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "我無意對你們的道德挑三揀四。只是，面對海洋，我們勢單力薄。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "請便吧，但我們時間緊迫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "踏上礁石。\n巨物躲藏在漆黑的風中，只有抬頭凝視，才能從一片昏沉的天空裡將它分辨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "伊比利亞之眼。\n一雙緊閉的眼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "text": "......好高......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "text": "那座小鎮上的雕塑，比例尺一定標錯了吧......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "text": "......長官。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "text": "這就是，我們曾經的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "text": "我也是，第一次親眼目睹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "二人無言片刻，駐足打量著這僅存於文獻與記錄中的恢宏景象。\n伊比利亞堅韌的現實仍舊超過她被教育的那般，艾麗妮如此想到。儘管那些深海獵人對他們滿懷不屑，儘管國家的平衡確實在崩潰。\n但這座燈塔就像是一個象徵。關於過去的風聲與野心。關於欲望與對未知的桀驁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "text": "無論你此刻心中翻湧著什麼情感，銘記它。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "text": "這些建築，這些破損的劍與燈，這些礁石，這片海洋。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "text": "要把人類究竟在鬥爭中建立了什麼銘記在心，時時刻刻。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "text": "若不敬畏犧牲，天秤則無意義。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "text": "是！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "text": "小心前進吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "text": "是！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你在做什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "text": "我們回家了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "不，還沒有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "但如果我們在這裡找到了凱爾希和二隊長要找的，也許可以。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "忍耐一下吧......就快了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "這裡太安靜了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "明明都是惡臭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "是，礁石上滿是溟痕的殘留，能看見一些人造物的痕跡，大都腐朽了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "歌蕾蒂婭緩步輕踱，抬首望向延伸向昏黑天空的高塔。\n伊比利亞之眼向天指去，就好像在這有限的土地上，生命伸長脖頸，想看見未來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "陸上諸國竭盡全力複製出了布雷奧甘留下的遺產，這些所謂燈塔，盡是對阿戈爾技術的模仿。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "text": "在這空無一物的大海上，這座燈塔又在等著什麼呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "text": "它究竟是看著海洋，還是看著陸地呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "二隊長。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "我知道。這裡本就是恐魚的巢穴，它們沒有立刻出現，也許只是一種防禦性的護巢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "它們也該來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐魚",
      "text": "（詭異的窸窣聲）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "數量......不算多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "海，這裡已經看不見海岸了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "懷念嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "不......只是在說，我們不能流血。在這裡，會很危險。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "它們還刺不穿我們的肌膚。只要不停下你的舞步，這些數量，還不足以殺死我們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬迪",
      "text": "（燈塔......果然和小鎮上那座雕像一模一樣。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬迪",
      "text": "（也就是說，家裡的那些圖紙，確實是爸媽留下的伊比利亞之眼的......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬迪",
      "text": "（我的父母曾經......就是在這裡......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "喬迪回頭望向海洋。\n每一天，他都會回想起自己所見到的那片灰濛濛的海岸。沒有活力的顏色，沒有希望的人群。\n可是，啊，看看這座燈塔吧，喬迪這麼想到。\n蒂亞戈叔叔說得對，他們都是英雄，他們本該偉大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "text": "......深海獵人們應該就在不遠處休整，她們也會參與戰鬥。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "text": "別忘了在鹽風城所見到的，她們的血很特殊，凱爾希並沒有向審判庭全盤托出。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "text": "明、明白，所以她們是不能信任的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "text": "你在審判庭地下看到了什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "text": "——呃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "text": "“海嗣”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "text": "你應當還記得它的扭曲，它的生命力，它的......平靜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "text": "在鹽風城，她們曾與那樣的怪物為敵，並獲得勝利。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "text": "我......我知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "text": "你已經見過真相了，那就重新審視你的過去和伊比利亞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "text": "撕毀腦海裡的舊景！得出你自己的判決。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "text": "是、是！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐魚",
      "text": "——（摩擦礁石的窸窣聲）——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "text": "它們已經準備好了。退守巢穴，伺機而動，現在來驅趕外敵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "text": "喬迪，情況如何？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬迪",
      "text": "是、是！真是奇跡，外面這些控制台還有反應，但我不清楚這些東西的驅動原理是什麼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬迪",
      "text": "我、我在找！我包裡帶著家裡的那些研究筆記！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "text": "......動作快。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬迪",
      "text": "知道！是這本......不、不對......咿，這本怎麼被弄濕了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "text": "長官！它們來了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "波濤洶湧。\n水面掀起數十米高的傲慢，日復一日地破碎，屈服於礁石與三個月亮。\n一個月亮明亮。一個月亮晦暗。這是亙古的月亮，掛在天上。\n剩下一輪月色，來自海浪的間隙，浪峰的頂端。\n月光來自他曾信仰的名號。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
